{"id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-finite-winning-certificate.md","title":"二值有效开博弈的有限获胜证书","display":"df-finite-winning-certificate — 二值有效开博弈的有限获胜证书","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-finite-winning-certificate","aliases":["20-df-finite-winning-certificate"],"display":"df-finite-winning-certificate — 二值有效开博弈的有限获胜证书","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的有限证书展开","source_printed_pages":[218],"source_pdf_pages":[247],"depends_on":["[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-finite-winning-certificate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-finite-winning-certificate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-winning-certificate — 二值有效开博弈的有限获胜证书"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的有限证书展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\">\\(A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)=\\{\\sigma\\in P:\\forall b&lt;2\\ (\\sigma^\\frown b\\notin P)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)=\\{\\sigma\\in P:\\forall b&lt;2\\ (\\sigma^\\frown b\\notin P)\\}\\)</span>；偶数长度节点由 I 行动。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WCert}_S(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(P)\\land0&lt;|P|&lt;\\omega\\land\\varnothing\\in P\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\sigma]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in P\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\\n\\left[(|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\exists!b&lt;2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\\land(|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\forall b&lt;2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WCert}_S(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(P)\\land0&lt;|P|&lt;\\omega\\land\\varnothing\\in P\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\sigma]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in P\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\\n\\left[(|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\exists!b&lt;2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\\land(|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\forall b&lt;2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限树为 I 固定一个行动，同时为 II 保留全部行动。每个叶节点已经见证进入目标有效开类，因此后续行动不影响 I 获胜。证书依赖指定开覆盖 S，但存在性只依赖目标 A。有限树条件可判定，全部叶的正向覆盖见证可 c.e. 等待；这里没有查询“某叶永远不在 S”的否定信息。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 15.1.2(i) 的有限证书展开；印刷页 218；PDF 第 247 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)=\\{\\sigma\\in P:\\forall b<2\\ (\\sigma^\\frown b\\notin P)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-winning-certificate}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WCert}_S(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(P)\\land0<|P|<\\omega\\land\\varnothing\\in P\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\sigma]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in P\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(P)\\\n\\left[(|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\exists!b<2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right.\\\\\n\\left.\\land(|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\Rightarrow\\forall b<2\\ [\\sigma^\\frown b\\in P])\\right].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2010,"backlinks":[{"id":"8609481d2b84cdde","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]] — 章 15；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-winning-certificate]]"}],"outgoing":["f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","93a810534b87b0f9","b73290a0af01d44f"]}